@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Lab1 Phase 1 SVG Editor - Implemented Architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

component "main\n依赖组装" as Main
component "cli\nREPL / Tokenizer / Dispatcher\nTree / Show / Help" as Cli
component "application\nEditorSession / Commands\nHistory / ShapeFactory / Ports" as Application
component "domain\nSvgDocument / Shape / Group\nLeaf Shapes / Snapshot / Contracts" as Domain
component "infrastructure\nSVG Codec / File Store" as Infrastructure

Main --> Cli
Main --> Application
Main --> Infrastructure
Cli --> Application
Cli --> Domain : 公开查询能力
Application --> Domain
Infrastructure --> Application : 仅依赖 ports
Infrastructure --> Domain

note bottom of Domain
不依赖 CLI、文件系统和 XML 库
几何行为使用多态，树结构遵守 Composite
end note

note bottom of Application
Command 必选；快照辅助撤销
D2 ShapeFactory 为后续插件化待重构点
end note

note bottom of Cli
D1 CommandDispatcher 为后续注册式扩展待重构点
CLI 不直接修改图形字段
end note
@enduml
